  "bio": "Adam Molina is a highly skilled tattoo artist operating out of Chandler, United States, specializing in geometric realism, exquisite black and gray, detailed blackwork, and intricate dotwork tattoos. Known for their meticulous approach and dedication to the art, Adam's work reflects a masterful integration of these styles, creating stunning pieces that are both unique and timeless. With a professional demeanor and a commitment to maintaining the highest standards of cleanliness, clients can expect a top-tier experience when getting inked by Adam at either I.F. Tattoo Studio or Collective Art Tattoo.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Chandler, Arizona, United States\n\n3rd Realm Tattoo \nappointment only\nGeometric realism Black&Grey blackwork Dotwork 📝DM to book 📍If Tattoo",
